# Same -3 on turn 3, but Bot2 discards an Island and an Ornithopter: it did not discard two nonland cards, so Bot1 draws a card
# (hand 4 after the turn-3 draw, 5 with the card). The control is
# garruk-veiled-butcher-minus-three-draws-nothing-when-two-nonland-cards-are-discarded.

